Chant the glory of the Moons, conjuring a shroud of dancing shadows that follows you as long as this spell is active.

Each turn, a shadowy beam will hit up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] of your foes within radius 5 for 1 to [47, 63, 75, 86, 95 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage.

This powerful spell will drain [7.6, 5.9, 4.9, 4.2, 3.6 (TL1-5)] negative energy for each beam; no beam will fire if your negative energy is too low.

You may only have one Hymn active at once.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
